<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Deathly Grasp</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Necromancer (guild level 60), Healer (guild level 120)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast deathly grasp &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast deathly grasp</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The last and deadliest of the wounding prayers, beyond harm: a grasp that 
opens grievous wounds on the target. The better your divine power and 
sphere, the deeper they go. It does about as well against any armour, and 
being a touch, a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cause Light Wounds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cause Serious Wounds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Harm</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>